                            "title": "`<object>` elements have alternate text",
                            "description": "Screen readers cannot translate non-text content. Adding alternate text to `<object>` elements helps screen readers convey meaning to users. [Learn more about alt text for `object` elements](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/object-alt).",
                            "score": null,
                            "scoreDisplayMode": "notApplicable"
